    "description": "Lot of 7 Maxell VHS-C HGX-Gold TC-30 Tapes and 1 Sony DVC DVM60PRR/3 Sealed\nThis lot includes seven Maxell VHS-C Premium High Grade HGX-Gold TC-30 video cassettes and one Sony DVC Digital Video Cassette DVM60PRR/3. The Maxell tapes each have a 30-minute recording time, come in gold packaging, and are sealed and new. The Sony DVC tape is a 60-minute MiniDV cassette, model DVM60PRR/3, sealed in its original blue packaging, made in Mexico, and new. All tapes are designed for use with camcorders and are suitable for recording or archival purposes. The items show no visible wear and remain unopened in their original packaging.\nDetails\nAttribute\nValue\nBrand:\nMaxell, Sony\nType:\nMini\nFor lotted Items please note that items may be damaged/missing parts/pieces/uncomplete set same with \"Open Box\" may not contain the complete set.\nItems are NOT tested for longevity or functionality. May still require repairs or new replacement parts. (Applies to items stated to power on/tested)\nThis item is in used condition. There MAY be some scuffs, scratches, stains/discoloration and scrapes consistent with previous ownership. Items may have damages seen in the photos and MAY NOT always be noted in our descriptions or vice versa. PLEASE LOOK AT PHOTOS, TITLE, DESCRIPTION AND DISCLAIMERS BEFORE BIDDING.\nNIB/NIP = New In Box/Package, IOB = In Original Box, NWT = New With Tags\nDISCLAIMER\nItems available up for auction are used, donated, previously owned, and are sold on a FINAL SALE and AS-IS basis without complete functionality/longevity testing. All items may exhibit minor scratches or scuffs, which MAY NOT be evident in photos. Severe damage will be documented in photos or descriptions when possible as accurately as we can. Prospective bidders should carefully review photos, title, description, disclaimers and ASK QUESTIONS PRIOR TO BIDDING, noting that bid retractions are NOT ALWAYS permitted. A new system is being used and may not always accurately describe the item, we are doing our best to ensure the corrected details are being added, but may still get overlooked. Please send us a ticket if you have any question regarding the item.\nMeasurements provided are approximate aims to indicate size/weight, and color representation may differ from in person with different lighting. Additionally, multi-disc media/ANY item that is a set may be incomplete, and buyers should verify state laws regarding the sale and purchase of gun magazines, which can vary. Silver/gold tone listed items have no actual fine sterling or solid gold/plated items in the lots and are mainly fashion/costume jewelry. If an item is AUTHENTICATED, it is by LegitMark and will have a COA, or CERTIFICATE OF AUTHENTICITY\nOur employees at HOT Goodwill Ecommerce use their knowledge, research skills, and Google Lens to provide most answers in the listing. While observations/efforts are made to accurately describe items, we DO NOT CLAIM EXPERTISE on any given field and may overlook details. If you have any questions about information not provided by our photos or our descriptions or item/seller/shipping tabs, please SUBMIT A CUSTOMER SERVICE TICKET and we will be happy to assist you.",
